  "notes": "M4.P06's probe (plans/m4.md P23, D75, D76), a build never committed (m4-probe-dump-3's plus a shadow pass): every gbuffers program writes an RGBA16UI target (Clear=false) whole with a per-pixel pattern and its id, which deferred reads back by texelFetch where depthtex0 < 1, and id * 32 + renderStage into an R16UI target, so check L4's pass outputs give each pre-deferred pass's renderStage values; deferred also writes depthtex0 and 1 as read and the shadow map's stored value, the forward reference and a hardware compare at each pixel, for the reversed-depth question of M4.P05's handoff and D77's tap. Views: entities (mobs, the held torch, sunlit terrain), coverage_items (the sign's text, the item frame, dropped items, the enchanted apple's glint, the armour stand), coverage_beacon (the beam, the campfire's smoke, the hand)."
 },
